{"4148470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Serenity Sketch","steam_appid":4148470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/9a8cc33bf8f63f1e95a79bc6c012d58a.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1319 height=76 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and paint with water in <i>Serenity Sketch<\/i>, a guided mindfulness sandbox. Create ephemeral art, follow gentle voice prompts in atmospheric landscapes, and find stillness in letting go. A self-care ritual where each evaporating brushstroke brings freedom and reflection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/f2d6375ea4816645000b6abbccf3fffe.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1245 height=128 \/><\/span>Follow the ancient practice of evaporating water painting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint water upon a stone. <strong>Breathe. Relax<\/strong>. Let Go of your painting as it disappears.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are invited to <strong>explore your creativity<\/strong>, by playing with impermanence. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/4329b4d142e0d50e2215b838b938904e.poster.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/4329b4d142e0d50e2215b838b938904e.webm?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/4329b4d142e0d50e2215b838b938904e.mp4?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/e1c75947204c1614c2bd0b5592bfd7a1.avif?t=1764763292\" width=871 height=128 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/513bf2d1e113efa249a80755b1425ed8.poster.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/513bf2d1e113efa249a80755b1425ed8.webm?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/513bf2d1e113efa249a80755b1425ed8.mp4?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, a gentle voice-guide will lead you through a unique painting Practice. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- copy a mysterious Glyph - draw inspiration from a starting image - paint along to echoing music - fill a blank canvas with your imagination - leave a message for another Journeyer -<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practices are designed to <strong>help you slow down, and reconnect with yourself.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, finish with <strong>introspective self-reflection<\/strong> questions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re feeling independent, take your brushes back to the <strong>Home Sanctuary<\/strong> where you can <strong>paint without guidance<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/600fbf447af55d47a3ff8f7e0d604dc8.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1130 height=128 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/85a49df011034be2756dbf8c28659986.poster.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/85a49df011034be2756dbf8c28659986.webm?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/85a49df011034be2756dbf8c28659986.mp4?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Each day's journey will take you to <strong>a unique natural setting,<\/strong> where your painting Practice takes place.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an ancient forest - a serene ocean bay - mysterious cliffs along the shore - a lively wood - ... and more - <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calming soundscapes will <strong>usher you into the present moment<\/strong>, so your painting flows freely.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, encounter <strong>new brushes<\/strong> and <strong>tools for interacting with the world<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/a7d1754762c6cd49725400cec6085285.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1027 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/924b9fdd21a8a1c80ea332b42963244a.poster.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/924b9fdd21a8a1c80ea332b42963244a.webm?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/924b9fdd21a8a1c80ea332b42963244a.mp4?t=1764763292\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins on the Path of Letting Go. But it doesn't end there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face surprising, subversive Trials at the end of each thematic Path.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if your inner journey can unlock your outer journey - are you ready for the next Path?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Trials may uncover pools of creativity and self-acceptance in your daily life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful water painting simulation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle voice-guidance for 28 unique painting scenarios<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introspective prompts to help you reflect upon your experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calming, immersive natural environments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle soundscapes that focus you in the present moment<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Elements: form a Fellowship of your friends, and journey together<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter new brushes, tools, and Paths in the world of Serenity Sketch<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing Tablet Support: basic drawing tab functionality exists. We are adding full features (pressure, angle, etc) in future releases.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developers and Project<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Copper Coin, an independent studio, with one fulltime member and a small team of part-time freelancers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started Serenity Sketch because we want to see more <strong>games that take care of us<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serenity Sketch is a gentle introduction to mindfulness and self-care, in an interactive mode. It is especially for those who have ‘bounced off’ of traditional meditation or sitting practices. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that building an inner quiet can unlock your creativity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first project, and we’re eager to hear your feedback.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to email feedback to us. Find our address on the Steam Support Contact Info section.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even better, fill in the survey embedded in the game demo.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/9a8cc33bf8f63f1e95a79bc6c012d58a.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1319 height=76 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and paint with water in <i>Serenity Sketch<\/i>, a guided mindfulness sandbox. Create ephemeral art, follow gentle voice prompts in atmospheric landscapes, and find stillness in letting go. A self-care ritual where each evaporating brushstroke brings freedom and reflection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/extras\/f2d6375ea4816645000b6abbccf3fffe.avif?t=1764763292\" width=1245 height=128 \/><\/span>Follow the ancient practice of evaporating water painting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint water upon a stone. <strong>Breathe. Relax<\/strong>. Let Go of your painting as it disappears.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are invited to <strong>explore your creativity<\/strong>, by playing with impermanence. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com