 drawing tab functionality exists. We are adding full features (pressure, angle, etc) in future releases.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developers and Project<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Copper Coin, an independent studio, with one fulltime member and a small team of part-time freelancers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started Serenity Sketch because we want to see more <strong>games that take care of us<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serenity Sketch is a gentle introduction to mindfulness and self-care, in an interactive mode. It is especially for those who have ‘bounced off’ of traditional meditation or sitting practices. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that building an inner quiet can unlock your creativity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first project, and we’re eager to hear your feedback.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to email feedback to us. Find our address on the Steam Support Contact Info section.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even better, fill in the survey embedded in the game demo.<\/p>","short_description":"Relax and paint with water in Serenity Sketch, a guided mindfulness sandbox. Create ephemeral art, follow gentle voice prompts in atmospheric landscapes, and find stillness in letting go. A self-care ritual where each evaporating brushstroke brings freedom and reflection.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/f970c9a2108959bf9f8e2877583967bae96a564e\/header.jpg?t=1764763292","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/ebf523c1b47f7d081de40fa753489d9471f0242b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764763292","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4148470\/ebf523c1b47f7